# Local adaptation of Arch's dotnet-core-8.0 8.0.32.sdk132-1 (local revision 1.3).
# Retains the package-manager-independent bootstrap and private locale fixes.
# Bound per-component shutdowns as well as top-level shutdowns, and reap
# orphaned build processes using the same approach as our Node recipe.

